                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">12</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL B - Build the twisting mass  |  B03 (Complex method)  |  EDUCATIONAL PROTOTYPE - not in the game repo.  Units: feet.
GUIDANCE: FROM MEMORY.  Stage titles only, generic labels, and several question nodes per stage - rebuild the chain from what you learned in B01 and B02.
New in B03: Graph Mapper (bulge at mid-height) and Sine (eased twist). Everything else is recall.
Red B03_Q## = question node.  Green _Correct = locked copy.  Blue _Choices = 12 locked wrong choices.
Questions: B03_Q01 Range (recall B02)   B03_Q02 Range (recall B02)   B03_Q03 Graph Mapper (new)   B03_Q04 Multiplication (recall B01)   B03_Q05 Construct Point (recall Level A)   B03_Q06 Addition (recall B02)   B03_Q07 Polygon (recall)   B03_Q08 Sine (new)   B03_Q09 Multiplication (recall B02)   B03_Q10 Rotate (recall B01)   B03_Q11 Loft (recall B01)   B03_Q12 Cap Holes (recall B01)   B03_Q13 Area (recall B01)</item>
                  </items>
